<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; How to Choose Best Packers and Movers in Ranchi | 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents should I ask for to verify a packer’s legitimacy in Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Ask for the company’s trade license, GSTIN certificate, IBA approval letter, insurance policy copy, and a detailed written quotation. Cross‑check the GST number on the government portal and confirm the IBA status through the Indian Banks Association website. These documents protect you from fraud and ensure compliance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I compare moving quotes without getting misled by low‑ball offers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Collect at least three written quotes that break down labor, packing material, fuel, and insurance costs. Look for hidden fees such as stair‑case charges or extra mileage. Compare the total fixed price, not just the base rate, and verify that each quote includes GST and insurance coverage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is GPS tracking really necessary for long‑distance moves like Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor the exact location of your shipment, reduces the risk of theft, and provides transparency during the 1,500‑km transit via NH 19. Reputable movers with owned fleets typically offer a live tracking portal as part of their service.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I look for in the packing material used by movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Top movers use a 7‑layer system: heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates for fragile items. Inspect the packaging on a few boxes to ensure it matches this standard before the move begins.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim relocation expenses from my employer or bank if I choose a certified mover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. If the mover is IBA‑approved, ISO‑certified, and provides a GST‑compliant invoice, most corporate, government, and PSU reimbursement policies accept the bill. Keep the original quotation, insurance certificate, and delivery receipt for a smooth claim process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is it important to verify the mover’s physical office address in Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A verifiable office shows the company’s permanence and accountability. It allows you to visit, check the premises, and see the packing materials and fleet firsthand. Movers without a physical address often operate as fly‑by‑night operators, increasing the risk of damage or loss.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does IBA approval differ from other certifications for packers and movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval specifically validates a mover’s compliance with banking and financial transaction standards, ensuring they can handle corporate and government relocation contracts. It complements ISO 9001:2015 quality management but focuses on financial credibility, which is crucial for large‑scale or reimbursable moves.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
